    "title": "Mason City man sentenced to 25 years on federal drug charges - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jason Eaton ,\n1 days ago A Mason City man has been sentenced to 25 years in federal prison on multiple drug and firearm charges. Darius Stackhouse, 33, was sentenced Oct. 1 in U.S. District Court in Sioux City after a March 12 jury found him guilty of conspiracy to distribute methamphetamine, four counts of distribution of methamphetamine and possession of a firearm in furtherance of drug trafficking. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
